This page shows each tag of the blog kit. The numbers are samples, not research data. A paragraph can hold **bold**, a [link to the cases](/cases/) and `inline code`.{% sidenote %}This is a sidenote. On a wide screen it sits in the right margin. On a phone, tap the number to open it.{% /sidenote %} The measure stays near 70 characters, so long text is easy to read.

## Text and notes

A second paragraph with a longer sidenote, to check how two notes stack in the margin.{% sidenote %}A longer note. It has two sentences, so it wraps over several lines in the margin, and the next note must start below it.{% /sidenote %} Plain prose continues after the note, and wraps around nothing.

