## Code and terminals

```sh
brew install nanaoki
nanaoki --split auto
```

```ts
const lesson = { cause: 'zsh_glob', fix: "ls -a '../web/.dev.vars*'" };
```

{% terminal title="after the failure · PostToolUseFailure" %}
```
$ bun run gen
! error: Script not found "gen"
└ This error matches lessons from your earlier sessions (nanaoki): [L1] Read package.json scripts first.
# a comment line
● Bash(ls -a)
> a prompt line
```
{% /terminal %}

| Error | Sample count | Sample share |
|---|---|---|
| Command not found | 120 | 31% |
| Path that does not exist | 96 | 25% |
| zsh "no matches found" | 64 | 17% |

