## Interactive pieces

{% compare label="Without and with nanaoki" %}
{% pane label="Without nanaoki" %}
{% terminal title="the agent starts from zero" %}
```
$ bun run gen
! error: Script not found "gen"
```
{% /terminal %}
{% /pane %}
{% pane label="With nanaoki" %}
{% terminal title="the lesson comes back" %}
```
$ bun run gen
! error: Script not found "gen"
└ [L1] Read package.json scripts first. Fix seen: bun run format:check
```
{% /terminal %}
{% /pane %}
{% /compare %}

{% steps %}
1. It reads. It parses the session logs into a local store.
2. It detects. It finds the errors that come back, and the later command that worked.
3. It writes a lesson. Each fix becomes a sentence or two.
4. It guards. A hook stops a few commands before they run.
{% /steps %}

